<h3> How to Run </h3>

Install Webots: [Download here](https://cyberbotics.com/#download)

Clone this repository:

git clone https://github.com/farah50/Webots_tasks.git
cd Webots_tasks/Arm\ Robot

Open ArmRobot.wbt in Webots.
Run the simulation to see the robotic arm perform pick-and-place tasks.
